win\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reithwin\">Reithwin</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202431\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.065 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.069 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2393/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 34368/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10541/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.023/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1035069/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   57.238      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   57.238      1 -total\n 45.33%   25.946      1 Template:PageSeo\n 45.11%   25.819      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 34.98%   20.022      2 Template:SmRarityItem\n 34.54%   19.772      7 Template:Icon_text\n 33.91%   19.407     28 Template:Trim\n 21.79%   12.472      2 Template:Item_icon\n 17.39%    9.952      2 Template:Uid\n 10.12%    5.790      2 Template:Template_style\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:9228-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202431 and revision id 326420. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}